          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "```js\nclass LRUCache {\n  constructor(capacity) {\n    this.capacity = capacity;\n    this.map = new Map(); // insertion order: oldest -> newest\n  }\n\n  get(key) {\n    if (!this.map.has(key)) return undefined; // or -1 if preferred\n\n    const value = this.map.get(key);\n\n    // Mark as most recently used\n    this.map.delete(key);\n    this.map.set(key, value);\n\n    return value;\n  }\n\n  put(key, value) {\n    // If key exists, remove it so re-inserting updates recency\n    if (this.map.has(key)) {\n      this.map.delete(key);\n    }\n\n    this.map.set(key, value);\n\n    // Evict least recently used if over capacity\n    if (this.map.size > this.capacity) {\n      const lruKey = this.map.keys().next().value;\n      this.map.delete(lruKey);\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nTrace with `capacity = 2`:\n\n| Operation | Result | Cache state, oldest → newest | Notes |\n|---|---:|---|---|\n| `put(a, 1)` | — | `{ a: 1 }` | `a` is most recent |\n| `put(b, 2)` | — | `{ a: 1, b: 2 }` | `a` is LRU, `b` is MRU |\n| `get(a)` | `1` | `{ b: 2, a: 1 }` | `a` becomes MRU |\n| `put(c, 3)` | — | `{ a: 1, c: 3 }` | Evicts `b`, the LRU |\n| `get(b)` | `undefined` | `{ a: 1, c: 3 }` | `b` was evicted |\n\nFinal cache contents:\n\n```js\n{ a: 1, c: 3 }\n```\n\nwith `a` as the least recently used and `c` as the most recently used.",
