U)\nget(a): returns 1; delete a set a=1; order [b,a]; cache {b=2,a=1}\nput(c,3): insert c; size 3 >2 evict first key b; order [a,c]; cache {a=1,c=3}\nget(b): b not present; returns undefined; order unchanged [a,c]; cache {a=1,c=3}\n\nNeed maybe note if get missing returns -1. The prompt says get(b) after eviction. Could say returns undefined (or -1 if using sentinel). Need maybe include final state.\n\nNeed maybe mention \"capacity two\" and \"LRU\" semantics. Good.\n\nNeed answer in final."
